{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00059",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.5,
      "end_seconds": 5.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "All set here, doctor. Chart's updated, and I'll read the readings out when you're ready."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.07,
      "end_seconds": 8.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Thank you. Right, hello, what's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 12.0,
      "end_seconds": 16.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.1,
      "end_seconds": 21.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Right, of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.33,
      "end_seconds": 35.43,
      "duration_seconds": 12.1,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a red eye. I don't know what's causing it. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.35,
      "end_seconds": 37.33,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Anything that helps?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.86,
      "end_seconds": 41.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "A cold compress helps a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.33,
      "end_seconds": 45.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.88,
      "end_seconds": 57.22,
      "duration_seconds": 10.34,
      "text": "It usually comes with a sticky discharge in the morning. Hmm, the sticky discharge in the morning? That's been since this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.71,
      "end_seconds": 60.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Any a gritty feeling as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.17,
      "end_seconds": 64.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Yeah. Ten days, uh, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.96,
      "end_seconds": 65.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.73,
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.08,
      "end_seconds": 69.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.23,
      "end_seconds": 72.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.26,
      "end_seconds": 88.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Have you had any pain in the eye, cold or contact lens?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.4,
      "end_seconds": 96.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "Well, I haven't had pain in the eye, cold or contact lens, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.8,
      "end_seconds": 101.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Any foreign body in the eye, loss of vision or sensitivity to light at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.68,
      "end_seconds": 109.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "I haven't had foreign body in the eye, loss of vision or sensitivity to light, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.61,
      "end_seconds": 113.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.97,
      "end_seconds": 117.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.96,
      "end_seconds": 120.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.06,
      "end_seconds": 123.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.14,
      "end_seconds": 138.8,
      "duration_seconds": 14.66,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.2,
      "end_seconds": 141.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 141.91,
      "end_seconds": 148.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pressure 111 over 68, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, heart rate 66."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.04,
      "end_seconds": 152.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Okay, noted. Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.85,
      "end_seconds": 162.53,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "I mean, it's hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.99,
      "end_seconds": 166.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.32,
      "end_seconds": 172.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "About about a year. I'm on diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 173.02,
      "end_seconds": 177.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 25 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.82,
      "end_seconds": 181.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.39,
      "end_seconds": 185.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "No, uh, I left it at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.34,
      "end_seconds": 192.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.47,
      "end_seconds": 196.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.94,
      "end_seconds": 200.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.25,
      "end_seconds": 205.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Uh, I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.01,
      "end_seconds": 208.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.68,
      "end_seconds": 211.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.92,
      "end_seconds": 215.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.62,
      "end_seconds": 217.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.81,
      "end_seconds": 232.67,
      "duration_seconds": 7.86,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.24,
      "end_seconds": 242.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.73,
      "text": "Yes, eczema. Arthritis in my knees, for about ten years. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.74,
      "end_seconds": 247.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Okay, eczema, that's already on your record. Good to know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.92,
      "end_seconds": 252.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.11,
      "end_seconds": 253.81,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.67,
      "end_seconds": 271.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.17,
      "end_seconds": 278.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "Oh, my grandmother had breast cancer. I mean, um, my mother has migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.45,
      "end_seconds": 284.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.58,
      "end_seconds": 286.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.12,
      "end_seconds": 289.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.51,
      "end_seconds": 311.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "The white of the eye is pink all over, and there's some sticky discharge on the lashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.45,
      "end_seconds": 313.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.73,
      "end_seconds": 317.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "So, stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.94,
      "end_seconds": 334.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Your vision is normal on the chart and the pupil reacts well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.0,
      "end_seconds": 347.63,
      "duration_seconds": 10.63,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.0,
      "end_seconds": 351.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 351.61,
      "end_seconds": 352.49,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.48,
      "end_seconds": 387.08,
      "duration_seconds": 19.6,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like conjunctivitis. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. I can't rule out a corneal problem yet. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a red eye, and no contact lens or foreign body in the eye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.71,
      "end_seconds": 389.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.27,
      "end_seconds": 408.89,
      "duration_seconds": 18.62,
      "text": "I'm going to order an eye swab, for red eye. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'm prescribing chloramphenicol eye drops, four times a day, for five days. That's for conjunctivitis. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 409.38,
      "end_seconds": 410.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 411.11,
      "end_seconds": 420.84,
      "duration_seconds": 9.73,
      "text": "Wash your hands often, don't share towels, and don't rub the eye. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 421.09,
      "end_seconds": 428.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "Right. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 431.23,
      "end_seconds": 432.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 434.88,
      "end_seconds": 443.1,
      "duration_seconds": 8.22,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if your vision drops or the pain gets severe, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 445.55,
      "end_seconds": 448.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "So, yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 448.74,
      "end_seconds": 451.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Come back if it's not better in three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 452.42,
      "end_seconds": 453.12,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 454.36,
      "end_seconds": 460.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 461.28,
      "end_seconds": 473.21,
      "duration_seconds": 11.93,
      "text": "So, um, I take the chloramphenicol eye drops, four times a day and come back if it's not better in three days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 473.81,
      "end_seconds": 478.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 479.69,
      "end_seconds": 483.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0073",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 486.83,
      "end_seconds": 487.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}